        "parms": "1. Click 100, then 60, 64 and 67: a chord, through flush into noteon. Click 0, then 64, to release the E. Now click the button: flush releases the notes still sounding, 60 and 67, with velocity 0, from the lowest up. The boxes show the last pair, 67 0.",
